claim_records.statement_tex:
For \(j\) in the declared class,
\[
\boxed{
Dj
=
\sum_{\ell=1}^{r}a_\ell\delta_{\tau_\ell}
}
\]
in the sense of distributions.

Assume the jump locations are distinct and the jump amplitudes are nonzero. If \(q\ge r\), then
\[
\boxed{
\rank H_q=r.
}
\]

If $A_M$ is bounded on a normed signal space with
\[
\norm{A_M}\le C_A,
\]
then
\[
\boxed{
\norm{f-\widehat f_M}
\le
\norm{s-A_Ms}
+(1+C_A)\norm{j-\widehat j}.
}
\]
